<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's PHIBOR rates mostly unchanged.</title>
<headline>Manila's PHIBOR rates mostly unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine interbank offered rates (PHIBOR) were mostly unchanged on Tuesday, with only the three and six-month rates lower, traders said.</p>
<p>Adjustments were made on the three and six month rates after all maturities in Treasury bill rates fell during the regular auction on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>Shorter-term rates were already lower on Monday.  </p>
<p>Average rates quoted by 20 banks were:</p>
<p>			  FEB 11		 FEB 10</p>
<p>    1 W		9  7/8		  9  7/8</p>
<p>    2 W		9  7/8		  9  7/8</p>
<p>    1 M		10  1/16		10  1/16</p>
<p>    2 M		10  1/8		 10  1/8</p>
<p>    3 M		10  1/8		 10  3/16</p>
<p>    6 M		10  3/16		10  1/4</p>
<p>    12M		10  7/16		10  7/16</p>
<p>    VAL		12-Feb		  11-Feb</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
